cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SSEE — Structural Self-Energy Expansion (V3.6)"
abstract: >
  A zero-free-parameter dark energy model derived algebraically from φ (golden ratio)
  and π. Seven papers spanning: algebraic framework (w₀, wₐ, EFT, Predictive Register),
  Bayesian MCMC validation (DESI DR2 + Planck + clusters), CMB confrontation (Planck PR4
  TT+TE+EE+lensing), algebraic derivation of all CMB observables from φ and π only,
  Israel-Stewart causal perturbation theory (gradient stability, MIRA origin, S₈),
  φ-Dark Matter two-sector model (m_φ=5.71 eV algebraic, fσ₈ 3.66σ→0.50σ), and
  canonical EFT (β_c=−AURA exact, αT=αM=αB=0 exact, αK=0.403 algebraic).
